{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000111639","bookName":"Regreso al Pasado: Reescribiendo Nuestra Historia","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000112613/41000112613.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":10057527,"followCount":137033,"introduction":"En la vida pasada, Yuli Ibarra no supo elegir bien a las personas. Se enamoró del hijo de su sirvienta y, al final, fue engañada por ese hombre, quien le robó todos sus bienes y la traicionó, llevándola a una muerte trágica. Hasta el último momento de su vida, Yuli no supo que aquel magnate, conocido por todos, había permanecido soltero toda su vida solo para esperarla. Después de renacer, Yuli decidió que haría que ese hombre y su familia se arrepintieran profundamente.","chapterCount":91,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[335],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":335,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Regret-Is-Only-the-Beginning","bookNameLower":"regret-is-only-the-beginning","shelfTime":"2025-02-21 13:50:16","firstShelfTime":"2025-02-21 13:50:16","performerList":[{"performerId":"24000","performerName":"Bin Wang","performerFormatName":"Bin-Wang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x0/24000/24000.jpg?time=1789721927721","videoCount":1},{"performerId":"23615","performerName":"Yun Yang","performerFormatName":"Yun-Yang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x1/23615/23615.jpg?time=1789721925946","videoCount":1}],"performerIdList":[23615,24000]},"chapterList":[{"id":"586612722","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/02/3x1/31x6/316x2/31621100014/587936620_1/587936620.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=Hvo4fnkSDQk1Z8ooDa40H66-J1YO7Wg1mfkfXZj5Z1b70IGqQFbP9nE6fzYgvBO2r8cpKJizKrqIR7DrwcpmzLQMORIGZseWltwupPjf~AL7VcX3ktQHHwAHTXkn9y19eupYAaLtE